#6200
Isles of the Pirate Lords~
This is the rest of Lok's area. Consists of 300 rooms, with 5 or 6 islands.
Links to ocean west of Black Market at 3601 north to 6287.
Links to Pal at 6419 east to 23517
Links to Myst at 6239 west to 16157.
Links to Jungle 16473 west to 6478.
Links to Freeport 22916 north to 6214.
~
